import overlays.dl
import source_queries.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI source tools
    members:
        workspace as a pointer
        view as a pointer to UI view
        overlay as a pointer to UI overlay
        node as UI reference
        document as a pointer to UI source document
        query as a pointer to UI source query
        items as a pointer to JSON value
        generation as an integer
        mode as an integer
        selected as an integer
        first as an integer
        rows as an integer
        position as an integer
        bounds as UI bounds
        edited as a boolean
        deadline as a floating-point number
        message as a string

to [dismiss UI source tools] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools}:
    if (tools's mode = 0) and (tools's query = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query)):
        return nothing
    if tools's query != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query):
        cancel UI source query (tools's query)
    set tools's query to @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source query)
    set tools's mode to 0
    free tools's items
    set tools's items to a new JSON-RPC array
    set tools's view's damaged to true

to [free UI source tools] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools}:
    if tools = @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI source tools):
        return nothing
    if tools's view != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI view):
        detach UI overlay (tools's overlay) in (tools's view)
    free tools's items
    destroy the value at tools
    deallocate tools
